        "filename": "board/cr50/wp.c",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 32,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002124
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-12-20T21:52:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It makes sense, but as you mentioned about handling the reset case I\u0027m not sure the asymmetry is worth it. Setting the flag for assertion first makes sense, but I don\u0027t think it matters what order deassertion takes place. To that end I\u0027d set scratch register first like the assertion path.",
      "parentUuid": "57b7b6b5_69ba3ca4",
      "revId": "b1d15d9e78a74bf19905180de296fcf770f0cf4b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
